Content:
Fixed p5xp5 and pushed. Good catch and thanks
@stuart I went back and double checked them all as a second pass. 
Seemed the v-cut checkbox was turned off on the  p5x1, might be good to regrab them all

@Andrew Wingate I just noticed that the 0p5x0p5, 0p5x1 and 1x0p5 BOMs don't have a defined capacitor value.

Should they be 1uFs, the same as for the 1x1s?

Also for all BOMs is it worth adding the LCSC part number, C19089236?
